@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/shift-templates

### 1. Listar todos
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Buscar por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 3. Criar turno diurno de 6h
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tarde 6h",
  "startTime": "13:00",
  "endTime": "19:00"
}

### 4. Criar turno que cruza a meia-noite
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Madrugada 8h",
  "startTime": "22:00",
  "endTime": "06:00"
}

### 5. ERRO esperado (400): nome em branco
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "startTime": "08:00",
  "endTime": "16:00"
}

### 6. ERRO esperado (422): início igual ao fim
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Turno inválido",
  "startTime": "08:00",
  "endTime": "08:00"
}

### 7. Atualizar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tarde 6h (ajustado)",
  "startTime": "14:00",
  "endTime": "20:00"
}

### 8. ERRO esperado (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/999

### 9. Inativar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/4